1
00:00:00,209 --> 00:00:03,209
(Sheldon:)...when I walked up to the podium
and looked out at the crowd.

2
00:00:03,379 --> 00:00:05,339
(Sheldon:)There must have been
thousands of people.

3
00:00:05,506 --> 00:00:07,586
(Sheldon:)My heart started pounding
in my chest.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,090
(Sheldon:)I began to hyperventilate.

5
00:00:09,302 --> 00:00:12,682
(Sheldon:)My vision became blurry,
and before I knew it--

6
00:00:12,847 --> 00:00:14,727
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear.

7
00:00:15,224 --> 00:00:17,394
(Penny:)-Oh, my God.
LEONARD: Sheldon?

8
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:20,850
(Leonard:)-Sheldon, are you okay?
-Don't trample me.

9
00:00:23,441 --> 00:00:27,361
SHELDON: Come on, Mother, you know
why I can't accept the award.

10
00:00:27,528 --> 00:00:31,238
(Sheldon:)With all due respect,
I don't think praying will help.

11
00:00:32,116 --> 00:00:36,076
(Sheldon:)No, I have not heard the song
"Jesus, Take the Wheel."

12
00:00:36,245 --> 00:00:39,745
(Sheldon:)No, no, no.
You don't need to start singing it.

13
00:00:39,915 --> 00:00:43,255
Yes, I'll buy it on "the iTunes,"
Mother.

14
00:00:43,419 --> 00:00:44,459
(Sheldon:)Goodbye, Mother.

15
00:00:51,052 --> 00:00:52,342
(Sheldon:)Hello.

16
00:00:53,387 --> 00:00:55,887
-Sit down. We wanna talk to you.
-Am I in trouble?

17
00:00:56,057 --> 00:00:57,977
(Sheldon:)Did my mother call you?

18
00:00:58,142 --> 00:01:00,022
(Penny:)Just sit.

